ying  for example the area's barber retrieves  his trusty scissors by pulling them out  of his own head  this implies that he was killed by the  very tools of his trade  then there's the chef who in his  previous life clearly found himself on  the wrong end of some serious kitchen  utensils  as for emily the corpse bride herself  viewers know she was killed by the  greedy and villainous lord barkus but  they aren't made privy as to how exactly  the act went down  however judging from the tear in her  dress the exposed ribs and the moment  where she catches a sword to save victor  we can assume that lord barkus took her  life  by stabbing her through the abdomen  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  animated classics are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one

